---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About | V8"
  description="Learn more about Vaibhav Pratap Singh (V8V88V8V88), a developer interested in Rust, Linux, C++, Web Design, and Cybersecurity."
  canonical="https://v8v88v8v88.com/about/"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Person",
      "url": "https://v8v88v8v88.com/about/",
      "mainEntityOfPage": { "@type": "WebPage", "@id": "https://v8v88v8v88.com/about/" },
      "name": "Vaibhav Pratap Singh",
      "alternateName": "V8V88V8V88",
      "jobTitle": "Developer",
      "description": "A developer who loves open source and coding.",
      "image": "https://v8v88v8v88.com/images/avatar.webp",
      "sameAs": [
        "https://github.com/v8v88v8v88",
        "https://t.me/V8V88V8V88",
        "https://www.youtube.com/c/MagicalV8",
        "https://www.instagram.com/v8v88v8v88",
        "https://twitter.com/v8v88v8v88",
        "https://www.linkedin.com/in/v8v88v8v88/"
      ],
      "knowsAbout": ["Rust Programming", "Linux", "C++", "C", "GUI Development", "GTK", "QT", "Web Design", "Cybersecurity", "Version Control", "Git", "FOSS"]
    })} />
  </Fragment>

  <main class="about-page">
    <div class="bento-grid">
      <div class="bento-item bento-hero clickable" id="hero-card" title="Click to read more">
        <h1 class="hero-title">Hi, I'm <span class="name">Vaibhav</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle" id="hero-subtitle">Building, breaking, but always learning.</p>
        <div class="hero-expanded" id="hero-expanded">
          <p>I'm Vaibhav Pratap Singh, usually known as V8 online. I've always liked asking questions and figuring things out.</p>
          <p>I studied computer science with a minor in AI & ML, but a lot of what I know came from learning on my own. I'd try things on my computer, break something, and work out how to fix it. Over time, that got me into Linux, open source, and systems programming.</p>
          <p>I like understanding what software is doing behind the scenes, which is what interests me about low-level programming. Lately, I've been exploring Rust. I'm also into cybersecurity and am a CEH.</p>
          <p>I work at <a href="https://automologylabs.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Automology Labs</a> and I'm building <a href="https://github.com/v8v88v8v88/XE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">XE</a>, a programming language and compiler project. I'm also learning more about LLVM and compiler architecture. My everyday setup is Fedora with niri.</p>
          <p>I like keeping things simple, the <a href="https://www.wikiwand.com/en/Unix_philosophy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Unix way</a>. <a href="https://principles-wiki.net/principles:keep_it_simple_stupid" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">KISS</a> is a good reminder of that. I've also done full-stack development for projects and freelance work, though systems programming is what interests me most.</p>
          <p>I also do graphic design and video editing. I learned design through YouTube tutorials, starting with posters and eventually taking on small paid gigs. Community work and personal projects gave me plenty of chances to use both.</p>
          <p>I served as president of The FOSS Club and have helped with communities like GNOME India and other student tech groups. I enjoy teaching, organising things, and sharing what I learn.</p>
          <p>Outside of tech, I read about philosophy, history, geography, and science, or whatever else catches my attention. I have ADHD and tend to jump between interests, so there's usually something new I'm reading about. I'm not much of a coffee person. I prefer some quiet time, a book, or a late-night experiment.</p>
          <p>If you'd like to chat about any of this, <a href="/contact/">feel free to reach out</a>. I'll get back to you when I can :)</p>
        </div>
        <span class="click-hint" id="click-hint">click to read more</span>
      </div>

      <a href="/username/" class="bento-item bento-ascii clickable" id="ascii-card" title="Why V8? Story behind the username">
<pre>██╗   ██╗ █████╗ 
██║   ██║██╔══██╗
██║   ██║╚█████╔╝
╚██╗ ██╔╝██╔══██╗
 ╚████╔╝ ╚█████╔╝
  ╚═══╝   ╚════╝ </pre>
      </a>

      <a href="https://github.com/v8v88v8v88" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bento-item bento-stats clickable" id="years-coding" title="View GitHub profile">
        <span class="stat-number">8+</span>
        <span class="stat-label" id="years-label">years coding</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/minimalism/" class="bento-item bento-philosophy clickable" id="philosophy-card" title="Read about my philosophy on minimalism">
        <div class="philosophy-carousel">
          <p class="philosophy-text active">I believe in <span class="accent">KISS</span> and the <span class="accent">Unix way</span>. Do one thing well.</p>
          <p class="philosophy-text">I appreciate the <span class="accent">Buddhist way</span>. Simplicity, mindfulness, and letting go.</p>
          <p class="philosophy-text">No gods, no masters. Just <span class="accent">logic</span>, <span class="accent">reason</span>, and code.</p>
          <p class="philosophy-text">Question everything. <span class="accent">Doubt</span> is the origin of wisdom.</p>
          <p class="philosophy-text">Life is <span class="accent">impermanent</span>. Build things that outlast you.</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <div class="bento-item bento-player">
        <img class="player-art" id="player-art" src="https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music128/v4/39/25/2d/39252d65-2d50-b991-0962-f7a98a761271/00602517483507.rgb.jpg/400x400bb.jpg" alt="" width="72" height="72" />
        <div class="player-meta">
          <span class="track-title" id="player-title">Stronger</span>
          <span class="track-artist" id="player-artist">Kanye West</span>
        </div>
        <div class="player-controls">
          <button class="player-btn" id="player-prev" aria-label="Previous track" title="Previous">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6 6h2v12H6zm3.5 6l8.5 6V6z"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="player-btn player-btn-play" id="player-toggle" aria-label="Play" title="Play">
            <svg class="icon-play" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
            <svg class="icon-pause" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6 5h4v14H6zm8 0h4v14h-4z"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="player-btn" id="player-next" aria-label="Next track" title="Next">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="currentColor"><path d="M16 6h2v12h-2zM6 6v12l8.5-6z"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
        <audio id="player-audio" preload="none"></audio>
      </div>

      <div class="bento-item bento-skills">
        <div class="skills-grid" id="skills-grid">
          <a href="/projects/" class="skill-tag highlight">Rust</a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="skill-tag highlight">C/C++</a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="skill-tag">Python</a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="skill-tag">JavaScript</a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="skill-tag">TypeScript</a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="skill-tag">Bash</a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="skill-tag highlight">Linux</a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="skill-tag">GTK</a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="skill-tag">React</a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="skill-tag">Docker</a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="skill-tag">Git</a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="skill-tag">Neovim</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bento-item bento-currently">
        <div class="currently-list">
          <div class="currently-item">
            <span class="currently-key">Working At</span>
            <span class="currently-value"><a href="https://automologylabs.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="currently-link">Automology Labs</a></span>
          </div>
          <div class="currently-item">
            <span class="currently-key">Building</span>
            <span class="currently-value"><a href="https://github.com/v8v88v8v88/XE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="currently-link">XE Programming Language</a></span>
          </div>
          <div class="currently-item">
            <span class="currently-key">Learning</span>
            <span class="currently-value"><a href="https://llvm.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="currently-link">LLVM & Compiler Architecture</a></span>
          </div>
          <div class="currently-item">
            <span class="currently-key">Using</span>
            <span class="currently-value"><a href="https://github.com/v8v88v8v88/dotfiles" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="currently-link">Fedora + niri</a></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="https://maps.apple.com/?q=India" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bento-item bento-location clickable" title="Search India on Apple Maps">
        <span class="location-icon">📍</span>
        <span class="location-text">India</span>
        <span class="location-sub">UTC +5:30</span>
      </a>

      <div class="bento-item bento-cta">
        <p class="cta-text">Let's build something cool?</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="/contact/" class="cta-btn primary">Get in Touch</a>
          <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iQFjSzPWcSA3sAt4WS-uKIUd7ReCz_hz/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-btn secondary">Resume</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matrix_digital_rain" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bento-item bento-matrix clickable" title="Matrix digital rain on Wikipedia">
        <canvas id="matrix-canvas"></canvas>
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <script is:inline>
    var philosophyTexts = document.querySelectorAll('.philosophy-text');
    var philosophyCard = document.getElementById('philosophy-card');
    var currentPhilosophy = 0;
    var autoScrollInterval;
    function rotatePhilosophy() {
      philosophyTexts[currentPhilosophy].classList.remove('active');
      currentPhilosophy = (currentPhilosophy + 1) % philosophyTexts.length;
      philosophyTexts[currentPhilosophy].classList.add('active');
    }
    autoScrollInterval = setInterval(rotatePhilosophy, 4000);

    var playerTracks = [
      { title: 'Stronger', artist: 'Kanye West', art: 'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music128/v4/39/25/2d/39252d65-2d50-b991-0962-f7a98a761271/00602517483507.rgb.jpg/400x400bb.jpg', src: 'https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/9e/cc/69/9ecc6918-a8dc-354f-909f-ccc20a0a7a33/mzaf_7863921970418240507.plus.aac.p.m4a' },
      { title: 'Jaago', artist: 'Lifafa', art: 'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music124/v4/a5/67/52/a5675288-d271-5947-0560-0ac19addb5f6/5060545638835.jpg/400x400bb.jpg', src: 'https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/68/53/83/685383da-e736-cd1a-1705-c6c3ee63a78c/mzaf_7201641971952177771.plus.aac.p.m4a' },
      { title: 'Runaway', artist: 'Kanye West', art: 'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music124/v4/d1/74/da/d174dacf-5782-dfe2-19f7-ce037dcd0237/00602527584935.rgb.jpg/400x400bb.jpg', src: 'https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/bc/dc/95/bcdc957a-6823-082c-0a9b-2be3ef754972/mzaf_11124816692667140659.plus.aac.p.m4a' }
    ];
    var playerAudio = document.getElementById('player-audio');
    var playerToggle = document.getElementById('player-toggle');
    var playerPrev = document.getElementById('player-prev');
    var playerNext = document.getElementById('player-next');
    var playerArt = document.getElementById('player-art');
    var playerTitle = document.getElementById('player-title');
    var playerArtist = document.getElementById('player-artist');
    if (playerAudio && playerToggle) {
      var currentTrack = 0;
      var applyTrack = function(index, autoplay) {
        currentTrack = (index + playerTracks.length) % playerTracks.length;
        var track = playerTracks[currentTrack];
        playerTitle.textContent = track.title;
        playerArtist.textContent = track.artist;
        playerArt.src = track.art;
        playerAudio.src = track.src;
        if (autoplay) playerAudio.play();
      };
      playerPrev.addEventListener('click', function() { applyTrack(currentTrack - 1, !playerAudio.paused); });
      playerNext.addEventListener('click', function() { applyTrack(currentTrack + 1, !playerAudio.paused); });
      playerToggle.addEventListener('click', function() {
        if (!playerAudio.src) { applyTrack(currentTrack, true); return; }
        if (playerAudio.paused) playerAudio.play();
        else playerAudio.pause();
      });
      playerAudio.addEventListener('play', function() { playerToggle.classList.add('playing'); });
      playerAudio.addEventListener('pause', function() { playerToggle.classList.remove('playing'); });
      playerAudio.addEventListener('ended', function() { applyTrack(currentTrack + 1, true); });
    }

    var heroCard = document.getElementById('hero-card');
    var asciiCard = document.getElementById('ascii-card');
    if (heroCard) {
      var activeCleanup = null;

      var pinGhost = function(source, rect, z) {
        var ghost = source.cloneNode(true);
        ghost.removeAttribute('id');
        ghost.style.position = 'fixed';
        ghost.style.margin = '0';
        ghost.style.top = rect.top + 'px';
        ghost.style.left = rect.left + 'px';
        ghost.style.width = rect.width + 'px';
        ghost.style.height = rect.height + 'px';
        ghost.style.zIndex = z;
        ghost.style.pointerEvents = 'none';
        ghost.style.transition = 'none';
        document.body.appendChild(ghost);
        return ghost;
      };

      var setExpanded = function(expanding) {
        var sharesRow = asciiCard && window.innerWidth >= 1025;

        if (!sharesRow) {
          heroCard.classList.toggle('expanded', expanding);
          if (asciiCard) asciiCard.style.display = '';
          return;
        }

        if (activeCleanup) activeCleanup();

        var heroStart = heroCard.getBoundingClientRect();
        var asciiStart = asciiCard.getBoundingClientRect();
        var asciiWasVisible = getComputedStyle(asciiCard).display !== 'none';

        // Expanding: ascii is about to leave flow, so freeze its current look in a
        // disposable ghost (its content never changes, keeps the real element's
        // inline state trivial and race-proof) and fade the ghost out in place.
        var asciiGhost = (expanding && asciiWasVisible) ? pinGhost(asciiCard, asciiStart, '2') : null;

        // Apply the real end-state instantly so content (bio text) is already correct.
        heroCard.classList.toggle('expanded', expanding);
        asciiCard.style.display = expanding ? 'none' : '';

        var heroEnd = heroCard.getBoundingClientRect();

        // Collapsing: ascii is already back in its stable natural spot (it doesn't
        // move), so fade the real element in directly, in sync with hero's shrink.
        if (!expanding) {
          asciiCard.style.transition = 'none';
          asciiCard.style.opacity = '0';
          asciiCard.style.transform = 'scale(0.94)';
          void asciiCard.offsetHeight;
        }

        // Hero card: animate its own real box (pin to start size, release to end size)
        // so the already-laid-out content progressively reveals through the growing
        // box instead of popping in after a content-less ghost finishes resizing.
        heroCard.style.transition = 'none';
        heroCard.style.width = heroStart.width + 'px';
        heroCard.style.height = heroStart.height + 'px';
        heroCard.style.overflow = 'hidden';
        void heroCard.offsetHeight;

        var finished = false;
        var finish = function() {
          if (finished) return;
          finished = true;
          heroCard.style.transition = '';
          heroCard.style.width = '';
          heroCard.style.height = '';
          heroCard.style.overflow = '';
          heroCard.removeEventListener('transitionend', onHeroEnd);
          if (asciiGhost) asciiGhost.remove();
          asciiCard.style.transition = '';
          asciiCard.style.opacity = '';
          asciiCard.style.transform = '';
          if (activeCleanup === finish) activeCleanup = null;
        };
        activeCleanup = finish;

        var onHeroEnd = function(e) {
          if (e.target !== heroCard) return;
          finish();
        };

        requestAnimationFrame(function() {
          requestAnimationFrame(function() {
            heroCard.style.transition = 'width 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), height 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)';
            heroCard.style.width = heroEnd.width + 'px';
            heroCard.style.height = heroEnd.height + 'px';
            if (asciiGhost) {
              asciiGhost.style.transition = 'opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease';
              asciiGhost.style.opacity = '0';
              asciiGhost.style.transform = 'scale(0.94)';
            }
            if (!expanding) {
              asciiCard.style.transition = 'opacity 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease';
              asciiCard.style.opacity = '1';
              asciiCard.style.transform = 'scale(1)';
            }
            heroCard.addEventListener('transitionend', onHeroEnd);
            setTimeout(finish, 650);
          });
        });
      };

      heroCard.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
        if (e.target.closest('a')) return;
        setExpanded(!heroCard.classList.contains('expanded'));
      });
      if (window.location.hash === '#story') {
        heroCard.classList.add('expanded');
        if (asciiCard && window.innerWidth >= 1025) asciiCard.style.display = 'none';
      }
    }

    var canvas = document.getElementById('matrix-canvas');
    if (canvas) {
      var ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
      function resizeMatrix() { canvas.width = canvas.offsetWidth; canvas.height = canvas.offsetHeight; }
      resizeMatrix();
      window.addEventListener('resize', resizeMatrix);
      var chars = 'アイウエオカキクケコサシスセソタチツテトナニヌネノハヒフヘホマミムメモヤユヨラリルレロワヲン0123456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ';
      var fontSize = 14;
      var columns = canvas.width / fontSize;
      var drops = [];
      for (var i = 0; i < columns; i++) drops[i] = Math.random() * -100;
      function isLightMode() { return document.body.classList.contains('light-mode'); }
      function drawMatrix() {
        var lightMode = isLightMode();
        ctx.fillStyle = lightMode ? 'rgba(240, 240, 240, 0.1)' : 'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)';
        ctx.fillRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);
        ctx.fillStyle = lightMode ? '#0f4d1f' : '#1DB954';
        ctx.font = fontSize + 'px "SF Mono", "Geist Mono", ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace';
        for (var i = 0; i < drops.length; i++) {
          var char = chars[Math.floor(Math.random() * chars.length)];
          ctx.fillText(char, i * fontSize, drops[i] * fontSize);
          if (drops[i] * fontSize > canvas.height && Math.random() > 0.975) drops[i] = 0;
          drops[i]++;
        }
      }
      setInterval(drawMatrix, 50);
      window.addEventListener('resize', function() {
        columns = canvas.width / fontSize;
        drops = [];
        for (var i = 0; i < columns; i++) drops[i] = Math.random() * -100;
      });
      var modeSwitch = document.getElementById('mode-switch');
      if (modeSwitch) {
        modeSwitch.addEventListener('change', function() { ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height); });
      }
    }

    var yearsCoding = document.getElementById('years-coding');
    var yearsLabel = document.getElementById('years-label');
    if (yearsCoding && yearsLabel) {
      var originalLabel = yearsLabel.textContent;
      yearsCoding.addEventListener('click', function() {
        if (yearsLabel.textContent === originalLabel) {
          yearsLabel.textContent = "wasn't consistent at all so it's a bogus shit XD";
          yearsLabel.style.fontSize = '0.6rem';
          yearsLabel.style.color = '#1DB954';
        } else {
          yearsLabel.textContent = originalLabel;
          yearsLabel.style.fontSize = '';
          yearsLabel.style.color = '';
        }
      });
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.about-page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: min(1050px, calc(100% - 2rem));
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 104px clamp(1rem, 3.2vw, 2.4rem) 3rem;
}
.bento-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0.95rem; }
.bento-item { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 17px; padding: 1.22rem 1.12rem; transition: background-color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease; position: relative; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06), 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px); text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
.bento-item::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 70%; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25), transparent); }
.bento-item:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1), 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25); transform: translateY(-4px); }
.bento-hero { grid-column: span 8; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 232px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.hero-title { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 1.2rem + 2.9vw, 4.4rem); font-weight: 400; color: #fff; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 0.42rem; }
.hero-title .name { font-style: italic; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5); transition: color 0.3s ease; }
.bento-hero:hover .hero-title .name { color: #1DB954 !important; }
.hero-subtitle { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 0.85rem + 0.55vw, 1.45rem); color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); max-width: 32ch; }
.bento-item.bento-ascii { min-width: 0; container-type: inline-size; }
.bento-ascii { grid-column: span 4; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 232px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: clamp(0.44rem, 0.62vw + 0.33rem, 0.59rem); line-height: 1.15; color: #1DB954; white-space: pre; text-align: center; }
.bento-ascii pre { font-size: min(1em, 8cqw); margin: 0; width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; min-width: 0; margin-inline: auto; box-sizing: border-box; }
.bento-philosophy { grid-column: span 6; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 1.25rem 1.12rem; gap: 0.7rem; min-height: 226px; }
/* All quotes share a grid cell, so the longest quote reserves enough space
   at every width without colliding with the heading or changing card height. */
.philosophy-carousel { display: grid; align-items: center; min-width: 0; }
.philosophy-carousel > .philosophy-text { grid-area: 1 / 1; min-width: 0; margin: 0; }
.philosophy-text { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: var(--fs-xl); font-style: italic; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); line-height: 1.45; visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease; pointer-events: none; max-width: 490px; margin: 0 auto; }
.philosophy-text.active { visibility: visible; opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
.philosophy-text .accent { color: #1DB954; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; }
